# A modal double-faced card in a hand has only its front face's characteristics (CR 712.8a): Shatterskull Smashing is a sorcery of mana
# value 2 there, not the land on its back, so it is no permanent card and Anticausal Vestige cannot put it onto the battlefield even
# with two lands (2 <= 2, so only its type refuses it). Sol Ring (1) is the control that is offered and put in tapped.

